Muninn
======

Muninn is a self-hosted app launcher and bookmark manager with a live-widget
tile dashboard: owner-scoped collections and boards with granular per-member
sharing, a full versioned REST API covering every layout mutation, and a
pluggable widget framework for at-a-glance service status.

Source repository: https://github.com/Emkraan/muninn


